summary: |-
  The Ledger branch merged cleanly after Aegis approved the M1/M2/L2 fixes:
  - a log.read:usage capability gates the usage feed, and a local tier can't pair it with egress;
  - the panel region sits outside the stack and refuses Buttons;
  - hue chips are not key-styled;
  - the split is clamped at the source.
  Ids unchanged. After rebuilding gnomon-contracts (stale dist caused 3 transient failures), the merged branch passes: gnomon 2402/2402 (the ledger and feed tests pass after the rebuild), gui 265, contracts 453. Follow-ups in a task: the host-level falsifier, signed-tier egress, mod auto-start at boot, re-render on focus, and checking whether cost is cumulative. Mistake to note: `git checkout -- .paradigm` before the merge discarded the regenerated index state, including lore/timeline.yaml; a reindex restores it.
